Gringo Hash (recipe from 1st alternative demo)

1 lb   Quorn beef type     (1 package)
1 pkg  frozen hash browns
1 pkg  frozen corn         10 or 16 oz?
1 can  black beans         not for Karen
1 can  black olives        coarsely chopped
1 can  diced green chiles  maybe 1/2 can?
1/2 lb sharp cheddar       grated
1/2    onion               medium diced
1 t    cumin               measured
1 pkg  salsa               pint from cooler?
1 pkg  sour cream          pint?

Mix it all together, bake in 9 x 13 pan 
@ 350 till done
